---
title: Lemon & Shrimp Cream Cheese Salad
author: Barbara Muirhead
category: Salads
source: Loving Memories of Mildred
---

@lemon Jell-O{2%packages}
@light cream{1/2%c}
@stuffed olives{1%c} (cut up)
@whipped cream{1%c}
@hot water{2%c}
@cream cheese{1%8-oz}
@celery{1%c}
@salad dressing{1%c}
@finely chopped onion{1.5%tsp}
@chopped shrimp{1.5%c}
@lemon juice{2%tsp}
@red pimento{4%tsp}

Dissolve Jell-O in hot water. Cool until syrupy. Soften cream cheese with light cream and add to gelatin mixture. Stir in celery and olives. Whip cream and fold into mixture. Put in mold.

**Shrimp Dressing:**
Mix @salad dressing{1%c}, @finely chopped onion{1.5%tsp}, @chopped shrimp{1.5%c}, @lemon juice{2%tsp}, and @red pimento{4%tsp} and serve on top of Jell-O salad.
